  "notes": "Divergence noted: BCD (css/properties/ruby-overhang.json) lists keyword 'none' as version_added: false in Chrome 151, while ChromeStatus summary and CSSWG issue #5912 record that 'none' is accepted as an alias for 'spaces' (restricting overhang to whitespace only). ChromeStatus record top-level status remains 'Proposed' (accurate_as_of 2026-06-29) despite active ship stage 260 targeting Chrome 151."
